<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vanguard Cellular upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vanguard Cellular upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston has upgraded its rating for Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc to strong buy from buy, a source at the firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 15-5/16 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
